<title>USA: Meridian Diagnostics completes offering.</title>
<headline>Meridian Diagnostics completes offering.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meridian Diagnostics Inc said Tuesday it completed the public offering of $20 million principal amount of its 7 percent convertible subordinated debentures due 2006.</p>
<p>All of the debentures were sold in an offering underwritten by Roney &amp; Co.</p>
<p>The estimated net proceeds of $18.6 million will be used primarily for acquisitions of products or product lines, the licensing of new products or technologies, and general corporate purposes, the company said.</p>
</text>
